Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.66,0:00:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.32,0:00:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Merhaba, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're going around asking questions right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I also know you've done stuff for Bob and the Widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I don't know the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.98,0:00:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But listen, I've got some advice for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.76,0:00:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a guy who hung around with your father many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows all about that time, and the Widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you because I think you're a decent guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I think you deserved to become something much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who wouldn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.82,0:00:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,God damn it, what the hell kind of shit have we ended up in?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.48,0:01:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think I could've been a different person,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,if only I'd had the chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I could, I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.14,0:01:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But who the hell are you to judge that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.00,0:01:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life isn't worth a pot to piss in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're no better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I don't see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.08,0:01:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hands are covered in blood and shit.
